  "job_B8.4.3.3_20251003_114855": {
    "chunk_text": "\u00fe\u00e6s folces yldran & \u00feara sacerda ealdermenn & boceras & \u00d0a cw\u00e6\u00fe he, \u00feeah ic eow secge, ge me ne gelyfa\u00fe. \u00deeh ic eow ahsige ge ne andswaria\u00f0 me ne ne forl\u00e6ta\u00f0. Heonunfor\u00f0 bi\u00f0 mannes sunu sittende on Godes m\u00e6gnes swy\u00feran healfe. \u00d0a cw\u00e6don hig ealle, eart \u00feu Godes sunu. \u00d0a cw\u00e6\u00f0 he, ge secga\u00f0 \u00fe\u00e6t ic eom. And hig cw\u00e6don, hwi gyrne we gyt gewitnesse, sylfe we gehyrdon of hys mu\u00f0e. \u00d0a aras eall hyra menegeo & l\u00e6ddon hine to Pilate, & agunnon hyne wregan & cw\u00e6don, \u00f0isne we \u00d0a ahsode Pilatus hine, eart \u00feu Iudea cining. \u00d0a andswarude he, \u00feu hit segst. \u00dea cw\u00e6\u00fe Pilatus to \u00feam ealdrum & \u00feam werede, ne finde ic nanne intingan on \u00feysum men. \u00d0a hlyddon hig & cw\u00e6don, he astyra\u00f0 \u00feis folc l\u00e6rende \u00feurh ealle Iudeam agynnende of Galilea o\u00f0 \u00d0a Pilatus gehyrde Galileam he ahsude hw\u00e6\u00f0er he w\u00e6re Galileisc man. & \u00fea he gecneow \u00fe\u00e6t he w\u00e6s of Herodes anwalde, he hine agensende to Herode; He w\u00e6s on \u00feam So\u00f0lice Herodes fagnude \u00fea he \u00fe\u00e6ne H\u00e6lend geseah. Mycelre tide he wilnode hine geseon for\u00feam \u00f0e he gehyrde mycel be him, & he hopode \u00fe\u00e6t he \u00dea ahsode he hine manegum wordum & he naht ne andswarude. \u00d0a stodon \u00feara sacerda ealdras hine an",
